bottled-onionshare
==================

This repository packages OnionShare for Cloud in a Bottle / OpenHost.

OnionShare
----------
This image installs and distributes OnionShare, a tool for anonymously
sharing files, hosting websites, and chatting over Tor hidden services.

  Upstream:   https://github.com/onionshare/onionshare
  License:    GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)
  Built from: the onionshare-cli 2.6.3 Python package, pinned in the
              Dockerfile (pip install onionshare-cli==2.6.3), which
              corresponds to the upstream v2.6.3 release.

Corresponding Source (GPL-3.0 section 6)
----------------------------------------
The complete, corresponding source of the OnionShare version distributed by
this image is the upstream repository at the v2.6.3 release tag:

  https://github.com/onionshare/onionshare/tree/v2.6.3

OnionShare's source is not modified by this package. The admin UI in this
repository (server.py, shares.py, templates, static) invokes the unmodified
onionshare-cli as a subprocess; it does not alter OnionShare itself.

Third-party components
----------------------
The container also installs Tor and obfs4proxy from Debian to run the hidden
services. These are distributed under their own licenses (Tor: 3-clause BSD;
obfs4proxy: BSD-2-Clause) by their respective projects.

